## 4. Sistem Routing

### Static Routes
| File | URL |
|------|-----|
| `pages/index.astro` | `/` |
| `pages/about.astro` | `/about` |
| `pages/blog.astro` | `/blog` |
| `pages/contact.astro` | `/contact` |
| `pages/faq.astro` | `/faq` |
| `pages/portfolio.astro` | `/portfolio` |
| `pages/pricing.astro` | `/pricing` |
| `pages/services.astro` | `/services` |
| `pages/404.astro` | `/404` |

### Dynamic Routes (Slug-based)
| File | URL Pattern | Data Source |
|------|-------------|-------------|
| `pages/blog/[slug].astro` | `/blog/{slug}` | `data/blog.ts` |
| `pages/portfolio/[slug].astro` | `/portfolio/{slug}` | `data/portfolio.ts` |
| `pages/service/[slug].astro` | `/service/{slug}` | `data/services.ts` |

Dynamic routes menggunakan `getStaticPaths()` untuk generate halaman pada build time.

