## 6. Data Layer

Data disimpan sebagai TypeScript arrays di `src/data/`. Setiap file export:
- **Interface** (tipe data)
- **Array data** (mock database)
- **Helper functions** (getBySlug, getCategories, dll)

### services.ts
- 8 layanan: Company Profile, UMKM & Katalog, Portofolio, Landing Page, Maintenance, Undangan Digital, Redesign, Web Scraping
- Interface: `ServiceData` dengan slug, title, badge, tagline, description, heroImage, detailImages, outcomes, process, metaDesc, listImage, tags, gridCol

### portfolio.ts
- 10 proyek portfolio (branding, aplikasi, webdesign, infrastruktur)
- Interface: `Portfolio` dengan slug, title, image, carouselImage, detailImage, descriptions, service, client, location, date, filter, requirements, solutions

### blog.ts
- 6 artikel blog tentang website & bisnis digital
- Interface: `BlogData` dengan slug, title, category, badge, date, readTime, images, content sections, keyPoints, reasons, tags, author
- Helpers: `getBlogBySlug`, `getBlogCategories`, `getAllTags`

### faq.ts
- 6 kategori: Umum, Harga & Pembayaran, Teknis & Desain, Domain & Hosting, Revisi & Serah Terima, Support & Maintenance
- Interface: `FaqCategory` → `FaqItem[]`

